  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for preparation of Organisational Strategy with World Food Programme, WFP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assignment is to assist the Royal Danish Embassy in Rome (hereafter Embassy in Rome) in the development of an updated organisation strategy for WFP and an updated Multilateral Partnership Agreement with WFP. The organisation strategy should be developed in alignment with relevant strategies and policies following the guidance provided in the Danida Aid Management Guidelines (AMG), and take into account results from and outcomes of earlier strategies and Multilateral Partnership Agreements with WFP, recommendations from relevant reviews and evaluations from recent years.</narrative>
  </description>
